{"schema":2,"shard":4,"views":{"accounthub":"\n    <div class=\"hub-hero\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Settings</div><h2>Keep account access and subscription controls easy to find.</h2><p class=\"muted\">Security and sign-in stay first for every workspace role. Owner-only subscription, integration and data controls appear only when the signed-in role is allowed to use them.</p></div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"logoutUser()\">Log out</button></div>\n    <div class=\"outcome-status-strip\" aria-label=\"Account settings status\">\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\"><b id=\"settingsActiveSessions\">—</b> active sessions</span>\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\"><b id=\"settingsLinkedMethods\">—</b> linked social sign-ins</span>\n      <span class=\"outcome-status-chip\" data-hub-target=\"billing\"><b id=\"settingsPlanStatus\">—</b> plan status</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"outcome-grid\">\n      <button class=\"outcome-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"accountsecurity\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('accountsecurity')\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">Access protection</span><b>Account security</b><span id=\"settingsSecurityDetail\" class=\"outcome-card-status\">Review password, active sessions and sign-out controls.</span><span class=\"outcome-card-action\">Review security →</span></button>\n      <button class=\"outcome-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"accountsocial\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('accountsocial')\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">Authentication</span><b>Sign-in methods</b><span id=\"settingsSignInDetail\" class=\"outcome-card-status\">Manage Google, Facebook and email/password access without exposing workspace permissions.</span><span class=\"outcome-card-action\">Manage sign-in →</span></button>\n      <button class=\"outcome-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"billing\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('billing')\"><span class=\"section-eyebrow\">Owner control</span><b>Plan & billing</b><span id=\"settingsBillingDetail\" class=\"outcome-card-status\">Review the current subscription and verified payment path.</span><span class=\"outcome-card-action\">Open plan & billing →</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <details class=\"hub-specialist-details settings-specialist-details\" data-hub-disclosure>\n      <summary>Owner administration <span class=\"muted small\">Connections and account data</span></summary>\n      <div class=\"hub-specialist-inner hub-grid\">\n        <button class=\"hub-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"integrations\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('integrations')\"><span class=\"hub-icon\">↔</span><span><b>Integrations</b><small>Connect supported external services without duplicating them inside the OS.</small></span><span class=\"hub-arrow\">→</span></button>\n        <button class=\"hub-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"accountdata\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('accountdata')\"><span class=\"hub-icon\">▣</span><span><b>Your data</b><small>Export the account data available through your owner self-service controls.</small></span><span class=\"hub-arrow\">→</span></button>\n        <button class=\"hub-card\" type=\"button\" data-hub-target=\"datadeletion\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('datadeletion')\"><span class=\"hub-icon\">!</span><span><b>Data & deletion</b><small>Review retention, legal-hold and owner-only deletion controls before requesting removal.</small></span><span class=\"hub-arrow\">→</span></button>\n      </div>\n    </details>\n  ","sources":"\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"between row\"><div><h2>Authoritative source registry</h2><div class=\"muted small\">Every executable rule should be traceable to a source, effective period and reviewer. CIPA publicly provides OBRS and register-search services, but this release does not assume a public machine-to-machine endpoint, authentication scheme or response schema. The production adapter must use CIPA-authorized specifications and access—never brittle screen scraping.</div></div><span class=\"badge info\">Governance control</span></div>\n      <div id=\"sourceRegistry\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"></div>\n    </div>\n  ","security":"\n    <div class=\"grid g3\">\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Security readiness</div><div id=\"securityScore\" class=\"score warn\">0</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Tenant boundary</div><div style=\"font-size:22px;font-weight:800\">Designed</div></div>\n      <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Production blockers</div><div id=\"securityBlockers\" class=\"score bad\">0</div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Production security controls</h2>\n        <div id=\"securityControls\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"card\">\n        <h2>Role-based access model</h2>\n        <div class=\"matrix\">\n          <b>Owner</b><span>Leadership view, company settings, people, evidence, tenders, billing and reports.</span>\n          <b>Manager</b><span>Operational management, people, evidence, assigned cases, deadlines and business workflows; no owner billing or destructive account controls.</span>\n          <b>Reviewer</b><span>Review work, evidence, approved rule changes and professional-review queues; no leadership cockpit, employee performance dashboard or billing.</span>\n          <b>Auditor</b><span>Read-only work context, evidence, control lineage and audit history; no leadership cockpit, employee performance or billing.</span>\n          <b>Employee / Reporter</b><span>Own assigned daily-report form only. No workspace dashboard, company-wide performance, HR cases, tenders, risk, billing, AI-management or administration.</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"callout small\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><b>Launch behavior:</b> the UI reflects the authenticated membership role, while write/read permissions are enforced again by the API. Hiding a button is never treated as authorization.</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <div class=\"between row\"><div><h2>Operational diagnostics</h2><div class=\"muted small\">Owner/auditor-only live checks from the production API.</div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"loadDiagnostics()\">Run diagnostics</button></div>\n      <div id=\"opsDiagnostics\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><div class=\"muted small\">Not checked in this session.</div></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n      <h2>Target production architecture</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid g3\">\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>Web / Mobile PWA</b><div class=\"muted small\">No secrets. Short-lived session tokens. Local cache contains no sensitive documents.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>API Gateway</b><div class=\"muted small\">Authentication, tenant checks, rate limits, request IDs, validation and audit hooks.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>Compliance API</b><div class=\"muted small\">Rules, obligations, scoring, cases, evidence metadata, deadlines and reports.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>Encrypted Database</b><div class=\"muted small\">Tenant-scoped rows, encrypted backups, migration history and least-privilege service account.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>Encrypted Object Store</b><div class=\"muted small\">Actual documents; signed short-lived URLs; malware scanning; retention and deletion policies.</div></div>\n        <div class=\"archbox\"><b>Append-only Audit</b><div class=\"muted small\">Security, legal-rule publishing, evidence verification, exports and privileged actions.</div></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  ","employershield":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Employees</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"employeeCount_v32_2\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Open HR cases</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"openHrCases\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">High-risk cases</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"highRiskHrCases\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Review required</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"reviewHrCases\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Start HR case</h2>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <div><label for=\"hrCaseEmployee\">Employee</label><select id=\"hrCaseEmployee\"></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"hrCaseType\">Case type</label><select id=\"hrCaseType\"><option>disciplinary</option><option>grievance</option><option>absence</option><option>performance</option><option>termination-review</option></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"hrCaseRisk\">Risk level</label><select id=\"hrCaseRisk\"><option>low</option><option selected>medium</option><option>high</option><option>critical</option></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"hrCaseSummary\">Summary</label><textarea id=\"hrCaseSummary\"></textarea></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"createHrCase()\">Open HR case</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>HR case register</h2>\n      <div id=\"hrCaseList\" class=\"muted small\">No HR cases yet.</div><hr style=\"margin:16px 0\"><h3>Employment Defense Packs</h3>\n      <div class=\"notice\"><b>Evidence assembly, not a legal conclusion.</b><div class=\"small\">Only evidence explicitly linked to an HR case and already approved in the Evidence Vault is included.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"grid g3\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div><label for=\"defenseCaseSelect\">HR case</label><select id=\"defenseCaseSelect\"></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"defenseEvidenceSelect\">Approved evidence</label><select id=\"defenseEvidenceSelect\"></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"defenseEvidenceRelationship\">Relationship</label><select id=\"defenseEvidenceRelationship\"><option value=\"primary\">Primary</option><option value=\"supporting\">Supporting</option><option value=\"contract\">Contract</option><option value=\"notice\">Notice</option><option value=\"minutes\">Minutes</option><option value=\"attendance\">Attendance</option><option value=\"leave\">Leave</option><option value=\"other\">Other</option></select></div>\n      </div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" style=\"margin-top:8px\" data-bw-onclick=\"linkDefenseEvidence()\">Link approved evidence</button>\n      <div id=\"defensePackList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">No defense packs yet.</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","partnerportal":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Client companies</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"partnerClientCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Open partner tasks</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"partnerOpenTasks\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">High priority</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"partnerHighPriority\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Overdue</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"partnerOverdue\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Client portfolio</h2>\n      <div id=\"partnerClientList\" class=\"muted small\">No linked client companies yet.</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Partner work queue</h2>\n      <div id=\"partnerTaskList\" class=\"muted small\">No partner tasks.</div><hr style=\"margin:16px 0\"><h3>Invite client</h3><div class=\"stack\"><input id=\"partnerInviteEmail\" type=\"email\" placeholder=\"owner@client.co.bw\" aria-label=\"owner@client.co.bw\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"createPartnerInvite()\">Send invite</button><div id=\"partnerInviteList\"></div><hr style=\"margin:16px 0\"><h3>Authorized clients</h3><div id=\"partnerAccessList\" class=\"muted small\">No authorized clients.</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n","recurringautomation":"\n  <div class=\"grid g3\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Schedules</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"scheduleCount\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Enabled</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"scheduleEnabled\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Next run</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"scheduleNext\">—</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"grid g2\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Create recurring compliance job</h2>\n      <div class=\"stack\">\n        <div><label for=\"scheduleType\">Job</label><select id=\"scheduleType\"><option value=\"weekly-compliance-review\">Weekly compliance review</option><option value=\"licence-renewal-check\">Licence renewal check</option><option value=\"tender-deadline-check\">Tender deadline check</option><option value=\"hr-review-check\">HR review check</option></select></div>\n        <div><label for=\"scheduleCadence\">Cadence</label><select id=\"scheduleCadence\"><option>daily</option><option selected>weekly</option><option>monthly</option><option>annual</option></select></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" data-bw-onclick=\"createComplianceSchedule()\">Create schedule</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><h2>Active schedules</h2><div id=\"scheduleList\" class=\"muted small\">No schedules yet.</div></div>\n  </div>\n","assurancefreshness":"\n  <div class=\"grid g4\">\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Current</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"freshCurrent\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Due soon</div><div class=\"score\" id=\"freshDue\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Overdue</div><div class=\"score warn\" id=\"freshOverdue\">0</div></div>\n    <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"kpi\">Stale</div><div class=\"score bad\" id=\"freshStale\">0</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-top:16px\">\n    <div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Continuous assurance</div><h2>Protection Freshness</h2></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn alt\" data-bw-onclick=\"runAssuranceTest()\">Run control tests</button></div>\n    <div class=\"notice\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>Automatic checks do not reset human review dates.</b><div class=\"small\">A control becomes due, overdue or stale when its review cycle expires, linked evidence stops being current, or a mapped published rule changes after the last human review.</div></div>\n    <div id=\"freshnessList\" class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:12px\">No control freshness data.</div>\n  </div>\n","propertyintelligence":"\n    <div class=\"hub-hero\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Money · Investments</div><h2>Underwrite the property before the story convinces you.</h2><p class=\"muted\">Enter the deal assumptions you know. Thebe calculates transparent cash-flow and financing metrics from those inputs only. Market-value estimates and professional valuations are deliberately excluded from this first release.</p></div><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"showView('moneyhub')\">Back to Money</button></div>\n    <div class=\"property-layout\">\n      <div class=\"card property-input-card\"><div class=\"between row\"><div><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Deal inputs</div><h3>Rental property scenario</h3></div><span class=\"badge info\">BWP</span></div>\n        <div class=\"formgrid property-form\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n          <div><label for=\"propertyDealName\">Property / location</label><input id=\"propertyDealName\" maxlength=\"120\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2-bed flat, Phakalane\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyPurchasePrice\">Purchase price (P)</label><input id=\"propertyPurchasePrice\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"2400000\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyMonthlyRent\">Monthly rent (P)</label><input id=\"propertyMonthlyRent\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"10\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"15000\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyVacancy\">Vacancy assumption (%)</label><input id=\"propertyVacancy\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.1\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"8\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyOperatingCosts\">Annual operating costs (P)</label><input id=\"propertyOperatingCosts\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"30000\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyDeposit\">Deposit / equity (P)</label><input id=\"propertyDeposit\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"600000\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyAcquisitionCosts\">Acquisition costs (P)</label><input id=\"propertyAcquisitionCosts\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" step=\"100\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"0\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyInterestRate\">Loan interest rate (%)</label><input id=\"propertyInterestRate\" type=\"number\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.01\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"Enter quoted rate\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyLoanYears\">Loan term (years)</label><input id=\"propertyLoanYears\" type=\"number\" min=\"1\" max=\"50\" step=\"1\" inputmode=\"numeric\" value=\"20\"></div>\n          <div><label for=\"propertyAppreciation\">Annual appreciation assumption (%)</label><input id=\"propertyAppreciation\" type=\"number\" min=\"-100\" max=\"100\" step=\"0.1\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"Optional\"></div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"actions\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"calculatePropertyDeal()\">Analyse deal</button><button class=\"btn alt\" type=\"button\" data-bw-onclick=\"resetPropertyDeal()\">Clear</button></div>\n        <div class=\"muted small\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">Blank optional fields are treated as zero. Loan calculations use a standard amortising-payment formula. Enter your actual lender quote and property costs for a meaningful scenario.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"property-results-wrap\"><div id=\"propertyDealResults\" class=\"property-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"><div class=\"card property-empty\"><div class=\"section-eyebrow\">Deal analysis</div><h3>Enter a purchase price and monthly rent.</h3><p class=\"muted small\">Thebe will show gross yield, net operating income, net yield, debt service, DSCR, annual cash flow, cash-on-cash return, break-even occupancy and an illustrative five-year equity scenario.</p></div></div></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"notice small\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><b>Important:</b> This is an analytical scenario, not a professional property valuation, mortgage quote, legal due-diligence report or personalised investment recommendation. Verify title/tenure, leases, taxes, rates, insurance, maintenance, financing and professional valuation independently where required.</div>\n  "}}